From: WebHTV
Subject: [P2-4] Opt-in Android FEL with a software-only enhancement decoder

Adapted narrowly from FongMi/mpv
06ec6e1746e5cbdcd271e613fdb1f7f7ecd36042. Keep the Android single-Surface
gate by default. gpu-next can consume a software EL only when the App
explicitly requests android-dovi-fel for a Profile 7 source. The BL keeps
its existing decoder; no second MediaCodec producer is allowed for EL.

